Description: @NAME@ @VERSION@ backport for Debian 13 (private prefix)
 Private-prefix build of @NAME@ @VERSION@, installed under @PREFIX@.
 .
 This exists so Celluloid 0.30 can build on Debian 13, whose own @NAME@ is
 too old. It deliberately does not install into /usr, so no Debian-packaged
 library is replaced and other applications keep using the system copy.
 .
 This is not an official Debian package.
